        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "\\#\\# About the Role\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n Vesta is seeking a \\*\\*Fullstack Software Engineer\\*\\* to help build the next\\-generation system of record for the mortgage industry. Vesta is modernizing mortgage origination through a flexible, open, automated platform designed to replace antiquated processes and enable fully digital customer journeys.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n This is a product\\-oriented engineering role focused on building, delivering, and maintaining functionality where business needs are strongest. The ideal candidate is product\\-minded, understands the business and customer impact of their work, takes ownership of product areas, and knows when to move quickly versus when to build meticulously for mission\\-critical systems.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Key Responsibilities\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- Build, deliver, and maintain product functionality in areas where business needs are strongest.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Own product areas and use engineering experience to maximize customer value.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Develop and maintain web applications.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Work with complex data models and relational databases.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Collaborate with product\\-oriented teams and cross\\-functional colleagues.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Balance rapid delivery with thoughtful engineering for mission\\-critical projects.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Take responsibility for commitments and deliver reliable results.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Contribute to a highly execution\\-oriented engineering environment.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Build software experiences that deliver value to and delight customers.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Required Qualifications\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*4\\+ years of experience building web applications.\\*\\*\n \n\n\n\n \\- Professional experience with \\*\\*React\\*\\*.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Experience with \\*\\*TypeScript\\*\\*.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Product\\-minded approach to software engineering and customer value.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Ability to take ownership and responsibility for product areas and commitments.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Ability to work effectively in a collaborative, execution\\-oriented team environment.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Preferred Qualifications\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n The original job description states that most listed technology areas are \\*\\*not hard requirements\\*\\* and are provided as relevant areas of experience. Experience with the following is therefore preferred:\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*PostgreSQL\\*\\* or another relational database.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*C\\#\\*\\* or another statically typed language, such as Kotlin, Go, or Java.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*AWS\\*\\*.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Kafka\\*\\*.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Redis\\*\\*.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Working with complex data models.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Skills \\& Competencies\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- Full\\-stack software engineering\n \n\n\n\n \\- Web application development\n \n\n\n\n \\- React\n \n\n\n\n \\- TypeScript\n \n\n\n\n \\- Relational databases\n \n\n\n\n \\- PostgreSQL\n \n\n\n\n \\- C\\# and statically typed programming languages\n \n\n\n\n \\- AWS\n \n\n\n\n \\- Kafka\n \n\n\n\n \\- Redis\n \n\n\n\n \\- Complex data modeling\n \n\n\n\n \\- Product\\-oriented engineering\n \n\n\n\n \\- Customer\\-focused software development\n \n\n\n\n \\- Ownership and accountability\n \n\n\n\n \\- Problem\\-solving\n \n\n\n\n \\- Execution and delivery\n \n\n\n\n \\- Collaboration\n \n\n\n\n \\- Engineering judgment\n \n\n\n\n \\- Balancing speed and technical quality\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Education \\& Experience\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\*\\*Education:\\*\\*\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- No specific education requirement is provided in the original job description.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\*\\*Experience:\\*\\*\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*4\\+ years of experience building web applications\\*\\* is specified.\n \n\n\n\n \\- React and TypeScript experience is required.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Experience with PostgreSQL or another relational database, C\\# or another statically typed language, AWS, Kafka, Redis, and complex data models is preferred.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Work Arrangement \\& Schedule\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Work arrangement:\\*\\* Remote\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Work model:\\*\\* Remote\\-first culture\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Location:\\*\\* Pueblo, CO, US (Remote)\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Physical hub:\\*\\* Bay Area\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Employment type:\\*\\* Not explicitly specified in the original job description.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Expected weekly hours:\\*\\* Not specified.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Schedule flexibility:\\*\\* Flexible time off is encouraged.\n \n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Weekend requirements:\\*\\* Not specified.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Compensation \\& Benefits\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- \\*\\*Cash compensation:\\*\\* $170,000–$220,000 per year\n \n\n\n\n \\- Final offer amounts are determined by factors including candidate experience and expertise and may vary from the stated range.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Medical, vision, and dental coverage, with approximately 100% of employee premiums covered\n \n\n\n\n \\- FSA plan\n \n\n\n\n \\- 401(k) plan\n \n\n\n\n \\- 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave for all new parents, including adoptive parents\n \n\n\n\n \\- Generous work\\-from\\-home and wellness benefits\n \n\n\n\n \\- Monthly cell and Wi\\-Fi stipend\n \n\n\n\n \\- Monthly DoorDash benefits\n \n\n\n\n \\- Flexible time off\n \n\n\n\n \\- Company offsites\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\#\\# Compliance / Additional Information\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n \\- Vesta is committed to equal employment opportunity and an inclusive workplace.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered in accordance with applicable law, including the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance.\n \n\n\n\n \\- Vesta participates in the \\*\\*E\\-Verify\\*\\* program as part of its onboarding process.",
